      ],
      "description": "All 55 native outputs follow their corresponding current inputs combinationally, without a clock edge, queue, buffering, reordering or stored output. The same equalities hold for invalid and stalled channels and while reset is asserted. Reset does not gate valid, ready or payload. The two port pairs and all channels are independent. clock has no direct output-latency effect; active-high synchronous reset initializes and aborts only the legal-history checking described in the input domain.",
